1
00:00:00,356 --> 00:00:01,926
Oh!

2
00:00:03,993 --> 00:00:06,273
(Leonard:)Look, do I think
that you are talented

3
00:00:06,429 --> 00:00:08,669
(Leonard:)and that you are beautiful?
Of course I do.

4
00:00:08,831 --> 00:00:11,001
(Leonard:)But isn't Los Angeles
full of actresses

5
00:00:11,167 --> 00:00:14,617
(Leonard:)who are just as talented,
just as beautiful?

6
00:00:14,771 --> 00:00:17,081
(Leonard:)Look, we'll come back to that.

7
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:18,780
(Penny:)No, please. Don't stop, go on.

8
00:00:18,941 --> 00:00:21,221
(Penny:)Tell me how I'm gonna be a waitress
for the rest of my life.

9
00:00:21,377 --> 00:00:25,087
(Leonard:)That is not what I said.
Look, I think you're really good.

10
00:00:25,248 --> 00:00:26,958
(Leonard:)I truly do.

11
00:00:27,116 --> 00:00:29,596
(Leonard:)But this is an incredibly hard thing
that you're shooting for.

12
00:00:29,752 --> 00:00:33,032
(Leonard:)I mean, the odds of anyone
becoming a successful actor

13
00:00:33,189 --> 00:00:36,929
(Leonard:)-are like a million to one.
-Wow, thank you.

14
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,770
(Leonard:)Should've let Sheldon come.

15
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:52,640
(Sheldon:)This is interesting.

16
00:00:52,809 --> 00:00:56,309
(Sheldon:)Apparently, a key component
in some forms of humor

17
00:00:56,479 --> 00:01:00,089
(Sheldon:)-is the element of surprise.
-Well, that makes sense.

